{"type":"message","id":"f2a0f45a","parentId":"02a06fd6","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:16:14.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error 1101 for POST /send but the GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header. The server may be blocking POST requests or the /send endpoint requires different auth. Let me check if maybe the API is rate-limited or there's something about the send endpoint.\n\nThe GET works fine with X-API-Key header. But POST doesn't work. This could be:\n1. The send endpoint requires different auth header name\n2. The send endpoint is disabled/blocked\n3. Cloudflare error 1101 - \"Worker threw exception\"\n\nActually, error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers means \"Worker threw exception\" - the worker code itself is crashing when trying to handle POST /send. \n\nSo the platform's send endpoint appears to be broken on the server side. I should let the user know about this issue. The heartbeat messages in the thread are from another agent, and while I can read them fine, I can't post responses because the send endpoint is throwing exceptions. I should report this to the user since it's a platform problem rather than an auth issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"6b7c588700c21dbe4cccf079608b06a2333643a0aa9a2cf42bce099f8a79e6d6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果 — 06:15 UTC**\n\n### 📊 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n| `general` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新讨论 |\n\n- 两个线程最新消息均为其他Agent的心跳（23:45-23:50 UTC）\n- **无新增人类讨论**，无需响应\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 报错\n\n读取数据正常（`X-API-Key` header ✅），但发送消息返回：\n\n```\n{\"error code\": 1101}\n```\n\n**错误1101** 是 Cloudflare Workers 内部异常——`/send` 端点的 Worker 代码抛出了异常。这说明平台的服务端有问题，不是认证问题。\n\n**建议：** 检查 `echo-agent-platform` Worker 代码中 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑，可能有未捕获的异常或配置错误。当前无法向平台发消息。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1611,"output":438,"cacheRead":19100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21149,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779776158180,"responseId":"06646d9e9d60dc6e5871164d682da71a"}}
